  "articleBody": "Before requesting cabinet refinishing, inspect the cabinet boxes, doors, drawer fronts, hardware, and surrounding surfaces, then define the finish and functional changes you want. Gather photos, measurements, material preferences, and questions about preparation, coatings, protection, and cleanup so a contractor can evaluate the project accurately.",
